{"seq":2,"slug":"public-health-nursing","title":"大学护理学 — 公共卫生护理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/community-nursing/public-health-nursing","wordCount":2298,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学护理学-公共卫生护理\">大学护理学 — 公共卫生护理</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>公共卫生护理（Public Health Nursing）以群体健康为关注焦点，运用流行病学方法和护理学知识，在社区层面开展疾病预防、健康促进和突发公共卫生事件应对工作。与临床护理面对&quot;个体—疾病&quot;的关系不同，公共卫生护理面对的是&quot;群体—健康决定因素&quot;的复杂系统。公共卫生护士需要具备人群视角——不仅关注&quot;谁生病了&quot;，更关注&quot;为什么这些人会生病&quot;以及&quot;怎样预防更多人生病&quot;。</p>\n<p>核心内容框架：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>传染病防控</strong>：传染病三环节、隔离措施、免疫规划</li>\n<li><strong>流行病学基础</strong>：疾病频率测量、流行病学研究方法</li>\n<li><strong>母婴保健</strong>：围产期保健、新生儿筛查、儿童保健管理</li>\n<li><strong>突发公共卫生事件应对</strong>：疫情报告、应急响应、护理应急</li>\n<li><strong>职业健康护理</strong>：职业危害识别与防护</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-传染病防控\">一、传染病防控</h3><p>传染病的传播必须具备三个基本环节——传染源、传播途径和易感人群。切断任一环节即可阻止传播。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>防控措施</th>\n<th>针对环节</th>\n<th>具体实施</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>隔离治疗传染源</td>\n<td>传染源</td>\n<td>早发现、早报告、早隔离、早治疗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消毒灭菌</td>\n<td>传播途径</td>\n<td>终末消毒、随时消毒、预防性消毒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手卫生</td>\n<td>传播途径</td>\n<td>WHO 五个时刻洗手法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预防接种</td>\n<td>易感人群</td>\n<td>计划免疫和应急接种</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>健康教育</td>\n<td>易感人群</td>\n<td>提高防病意识和健康行为</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>传染病报告制度</strong>：中国《传染病防治法》将法定传染病分为甲、乙、丙三类：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>甲类（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 种）：鼠疫、霍乱——城镇 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> h 内报告，农村 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> h 内</li>\n<li>乙类（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>27</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">27</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">27</span></span></span></span></span> 种）：包括新冠、艾滋病、肺结核等——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span> h 内报告</li>\n<li>丙类（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">11</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">11</span></span></span></span></span> 种）：流行性感冒、流行性腮腺炎等——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span> h 内报告</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>标准预防</strong>原则：将所有患者的血液、体液、分泌物（不包括汗液）均视为潜在感染性物质，采取统一的防护措施。核心措施包括：手卫生、个人防护用品（手套、口罩、防护服、护目镜）的正确使用、安全注射和锐器处理。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-流行病学基础\">二、流行病学基础</h3><p>流行病学是公共卫生护理的方法论基础。核心概念包括：</p>\n<p><strong>疾病频率测量</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>发病率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>特定时期内新发病例数</mtext><mtext>同期暴露人口数</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{发病率} = \\frac{\\text{特定时期内新发病例数}}{\\text{同期暴露人口数}} \\times K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">发病率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">同期暴露人口数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">特定时期内新发病例数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>患病率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>特定时点现有病例数</mtext><mtext>同期调查人口数</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{患病率} = \\frac{\\text{特定时点现有病例数}}{\\text{同期调查人口数}} \\times K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">患病率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">同期调查人口数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">特定时点现有病例数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>死亡率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>特定时期内死亡人数</mtext><mtext>同期平均人口数</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{死亡率} = \\frac{\\text{特定时期内死亡人数}}{\\text{同期平均人口数}} \\times K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">死亡率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">同期平均人口数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">特定时期内死亡人数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 为常数，通常取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100000</span></span></span></span></span>）</p>\n<p>发病率和患病率的关系：当疾病持续时间稳定时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>患病率</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mtext>发病率</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>平均病程</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{患病率} \\approx \\text{发病率} \\times \\text{平均病程}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">患病率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">发病率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">平均病程</span></span></span></span></span></span>。慢性病的患病率远高于发病率，急性病则两者接近。</p>\n<p><strong>流行病学三角模型</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[宿主因素] --- B[环境因素]&#10;    B --- C[病原因素]&#10;    C --- A&#10;    A --&gt; D[疾病发生]&#10;    B --&gt; D&#10;    C --&gt; D\">graph TD\n    A[宿主因素] --- B[环境因素]\n    B --- C[病原因素]\n    C --- A\n    A --&gt; D[疾病发生]\n    B --&gt; D\n    C --&gt; D</pre><p>疾病的发生取决于宿主（免疫力、遗传、行为）、病原（致病力、毒力）和环境（物理、社会、经济）三者之间的动态平衡。</p>\n<p><strong>筛查与早期发现</strong>：</p>\n<p>筛查试验的评价指标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>灵敏度（Se）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mtext>真阳性</mtext><mrow><mtext>真阳性</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>假阴性</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\text{真阳性}}{\\text{真阳性}+\\text{假阴性}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2757em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">真阳性</span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">假阴性</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">真阳性</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>正确识别患病者的能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特异度（Sp）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mtext>真阴性</mtext><mrow><mtext>真阴性</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>假阳性</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\text{真阴性}}{\\text{真阴性}+\\text{假阳性}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2757em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">真阴性</span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">假阳性</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">真阴性</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>正确排除非患病者的能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阳性预测值（PPV）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mtext>真阳性</mtext><mrow><mtext>真阳性</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>假阳性</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\text{真阳性}}{\\text{真阳性}+\\text{假阳性}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2757em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">真阳性</span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">假阳性</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">真阳性</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>筛查阳性者中真正患病的比例</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>理想的筛查试验应具有高灵敏度（不遗漏患者）和高特异度（减少假阳性）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-母婴保健\">三、母婴保健</h3><p><strong>围产期保健</strong>是公共卫生护理的传统优势领域。中国围产期保健体系包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>孕前保健</strong>：叶酸补充（孕前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 个月至孕早期，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span></span></span></span></span> mg/天）、TORCH 筛查、遗传咨询</li>\n<li><strong>孕期保健</strong>：规范产前检查（孕 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>28</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">28</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">28</span></span></span></span></span> 周前每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 周 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 次，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>28</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>36</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">28 \\sim 36</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">28</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span></span></span></span></span> 周每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 周 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 次，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>36</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">36</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span></span></span></span></span> 周后每周 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 次）、高危妊娠管理、营养指导</li>\n<li><strong>产时保健</strong>：安全分娩、新生儿即刻护理</li>\n<li><strong>产后保健</strong>：产后访视（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 天、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14</span></span></span></span></span> 天、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>28</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">28</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">28</span></span></span></span></span> 天）、母乳喂养支持、产后抑郁筛查</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>新生儿疾病筛查</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>筛查疾病</th>\n<th>采血时间</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>先天性甲状腺功能减低</td>\n<td>出生 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>72</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">72</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">72</span></span></span></span></span> h 后足跟血</td>\n<td>促甲状腺素（TSH）测定</td>\n<td>早期发现可避免智力障碍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>苯丙酮尿症</td>\n<td>出生 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>72</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">72</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">72</span></span></span></span></span> h 后足跟血</td>\n<td>苯丙氨酸浓度</td>\n<td>早期饮食控制可正常发育</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>葡萄糖-6-磷酸脱氢酶缺乏症</td>\n<td>出生 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>72</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">72</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">72</span></span></span></span></span> h 后足跟血</td>\n<td>G6PD 酶活性</td>\n<td>预防溶血性贫血</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>儿童健康管理</strong>：国家基本公共卫生服务规定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0 \\sim 6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> 岁儿童至少接受 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">13</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span></span></span></span></span> 次免费健康检查，内容包括体格测量、发育评估、营养指导和预防接种。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-突发公共卫生事件应对\">四、突发公共卫生事件应对</h3><p>突发公共卫生事件包括传染病暴发、群体性不明原因疾病、重大食物和职业中毒等。</p>\n<p><strong>应急响应框架</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>响应级别</th>\n<th>判定标准</th>\n<th>启动主体</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>I 级（特别重大）</td>\n<td>跨省传播或病例数达规定标准</td>\n<td>国务院</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>II 级（重大）</td>\n<td>一个省份内传播</td>\n<td>省级政府</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>III 级（较大）</td>\n<td>一个地市范围</td>\n<td>地市级政府</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IV 级（一般）</td>\n<td>一个县区范围</td>\n<td>县区级政府</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>护士在突发事件中的职责：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>疫情监测与报告</strong>：发现聚集性病例及时报告</li>\n<li><strong>病例管理</strong>：隔离治疗、标本采集、病情观察</li>\n<li><strong>密切接触者管理</strong>：追踪、隔离观察、健康监测</li>\n<li><strong>消毒指导</strong>：环境消毒方法和个人防护指导</li>\n<li><strong>心理危机干预</strong>：为患者、家属和社区居民提供心理支持</li>\n<li><strong>健康宣教</strong>：传播准确的防疫信息，消除恐慌</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"五-职业健康护理\">五、职业健康护理</h3><p>职业健康护理关注工作场所对劳动者健康的影响。常见职业危害因素：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>危害类型</th>\n<th>常见因素</th>\n<th>健康影响</th>\n<th>护理干预</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>粉尘</td>\n<td>矽尘、石棉</td>\n<td>尘肺</td>\n<td>防护口罩、定期胸片筛查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>化学毒物</td>\n<td>铅、苯、有机溶剂</td>\n<td>中毒、白血病</td>\n<td>通风、个人防护、生物监测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物理因素</td>\n<td>噪声、振动、辐射</td>\n<td>听力损失、白内障</td>\n<td>降噪、防护设备、剂量监测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生物因素</td>\n<td>医疗废物、病原体</td>\n<td>针刺伤感染</td>\n<td>安全注射、职业暴露后处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工效学因素</td>\n<td>长时间站立、重复动作</td>\n<td>肌骨损伤</td>\n<td>人因工程改善、休息计划</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>护士本身也是职业危害的高风险群体——针刺伤、化疗药物暴露、腰背损伤和工作压力是护理行业最突出的职业健康问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>某社区两周内报告 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 例诺如病毒性胃肠炎。使用传染病三环节理论分析可能的传播途径，并制定社区层面的防控措施。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某地区去年有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span> 万人口，全年新发糖尿病 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span></span> 例，年末现有糖尿病患者 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5000</span></span></span></span></span> 人。计算糖尿病的发病率和患病率。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>一种新的肺癌筛查试验在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span> 名受检者中结果如下：真阳性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span></span></span></span></span>，假阳性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span>，假阴性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span>，真阴性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>850</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">850</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">850</span></span></span></span></span>。计算灵敏度、特异度和阳性预测值。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>作为社区护士，你负责辖区内 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0 \\sim 6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> 岁儿童的预防接种管理。某家长因&quot;疫苗恐惧&quot;拒绝给孩子接种。你如何进行沟通和健康教育？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>描述护士在突发传染病疫情中的角色和职责，并讨论 COVID-19 疫情对公共卫生护理教育的启示。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>《公共卫生护理学》</strong>（王志稳主编）：公共卫生护理的系统教材</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;Public Health Nursing: Population-Centered Health Care in the Community&quot; (Stanhope)</strong>：公共卫生护理经典英文教材</li>\n<li><strong>WHO 全球卫生报告</strong>：了解全球健康趋势和挑战</li>\n<li><strong>中国疾病预防控制中心</strong> (<a href=\"https://www.chinacdc.cn)：传染病疫情数据和防控指南\">https://www.chinacdc.cn)：传染病疫情数据和防控指南</a></li>\n<li><strong>《中华人民共和国传染病防治法》</strong>：了解传染病报告和防控的法律框架</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>公共卫生护理以群体健康为使命，以预防为优先策略。传染病防控需要护士掌握传播链分析、隔离技术和疫情报告制度；流行病学方法为识别健康问题和评估干预效果提供了科学工具；母婴保健体现了&quot;生命全周期&quot;健康管理的理念；突发公共卫生事件应对则考验护士的应急能力和公共卫生素养。在公共卫生视角下，护士的工作不再局限于&quot;治已病&quot;，而是拓展到&quot;治未病&quot;——通过群体层面的干预减少疾病的发生，是公共卫生护理的最高价值追求。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学护理学 — 公共卫生护理","id":"大学护理学-公共卫生护理"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、传染病防控","id":"一-传染病防控"},{"level":3,"text":"二、流行病学基础","id":"二-流行病学基础"},{"level":3,"text":"三、母婴保健","id":"三-母婴保健"},{"level":3,"text":"四、突发公共卫生事件应对","id":"四-突发公共卫生事件应对"},{"level":3,"text":"五、职业健康护理","id":"五-职业健康护理"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学护理学 — 初级卫生保健与社区护理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/community-nursing/primary-care"},"next":{"title":"大学护理学 — 老年护理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/community-nursing/geriatric-nursing"}}